  "id": "multiparous",
  "term": "multiparous",
  "definition": "Multiparous refers to a family or parent who has already had a child before, rather than being in a first birth experience. In this context, multiparous families are described as having more established parenting routines while also managing added demands such as caring for older children and handling greater time and household pressures.",
